Welcome to ESP32-P4 MicroCore.

SD card is /mnt/sd (FAT). Extra files you copy from a PC show up there.
Extensions: put .tcz files in /mnt/sd/tce and list them in onboot.lst,
or run:  tce-load -i foo.tcz

GPIO:  gpio list | gpio set 5 1 | gpio get 5
Wi-Fi: copy opt/wifi.conf on the card, or  wifi-setup
SSH:   copy an ed25519 pubkey to home/tc/.ssh/authorized_keys
       then  ssh tc@<wlan0-ip>  (key-only)
